constant temperature: q = −w</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"a5dbccea-d8fe-4f91-b8cd-928834b48b60\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>When no work is done: ΔU = q</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>When no work is done: ΔU = q</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"535ceb46-5277-410a-b3e0-d896f67a7b95\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>In gaseous system: ΔU = q + PΔV</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>In gaseous system: ΔU = q + PΔV</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"e826d9b1-d5f3-4d0c-9ab6-e270a470a30f\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>When work is done by the system: ΔU = q + w</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>When work is done by the system: ΔU = q + w</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>According to the first law of thermodynamics, ΔU = q + w. In special cases the statement can be expressed in different ways. Which of the following is not a correct expression?</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"chapterId\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:12:28.2+00:00\",\"subjectId\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:12:28.2+00:00\",\"chapter_id\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"subject_id\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"explanation\":[],\"chapter_name\":\"Thermodynamics\",\"optionLayout\":\"grid_2x2\",\"questionCode\":\"CHE-THE-6169\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"subject_name\":\"Chemistry\",\"correctAnswer\":\"D\",\"correctOption\":\"d\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"question_code\":\"CHE-THE-6169\",\"question_type\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"correct_option\":\"d\"},\"questionId\":\"19ce7a61-413a-4e9e-aaac-ed040e71f98b\"},{\"id\":\"blk-1788170102677-0-6\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"e3652efd-2806-4041-a873-737175404307\",\"year\":null,\"marks\":4,\"source\":\"System Admin\",\"chapter\":\"Thermodynamics\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1\",\"text\":\"<p>The work done during the expansion of a gas from 4 dm³ to 6 dm³ against a constant external pressure of 3 atm is (1 L atm = 101.32 J)</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"1e921e05-7491-482f-979e-b58f4ca14213\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>−6 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>−6 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"0e0165ab-5405-4040-89bc-9f18bf881a74\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>−608 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>−608 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"bbc30c88-c314-4876-b466-a8995cacd862\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>+304 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>+304 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"ad6d1c0e-d890-48ac-9b71-dbeea7ea2eca\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>−304 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>−304 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>The work done during the expansion of a gas from 4 dm³ to 6 dm³ against a constant external pressure of 3 atm is (1 L atm = 101.32 J)</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"chapterId\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:13:31.183+00:00\",\"subjectId\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:13:31.183+00:00\",\"chapter_id\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"subject_id\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"explanation\":[],\"chapter_name\":\"Thermodynamics\",\"optionLayout\":\"grid_2x2\",\"questionCode\":\"CHE-THE-8583\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"subject_name\":\"Chemistry\",\"correctAnswer\":\"B\",\"correctOption\":\"b\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"question_code\":\"CHE-THE-8583\",\"question_type\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"correct_option\":\"b\"},\"questionId\":\"e3652efd-2806-4041-a873-737175404307\"},{\"id\":\"blk-1788170102677-0-7\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\