 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Two litres of an ideal gas at a pressure of 10 atm expands isothermally into a vacuum until its total volume is 10 litres. How much heat is absorbed and how much work is done in the expansion?</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"chapterId\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:21:33.031+00:00\",\"subjectId\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:21:33.031+00:00\",\"chapter_id\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b17\",\"difficulty\":\"Easy\",\"subject_id\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"explanation\":[],\"chapter_name\":\"Thermodynamics\",\"optionLayout\":\"grid_2x2\",\"questionCode\":\"CHE-THE-8034\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"subject_name\":\"Chemistry\",\"correctAnswer\":\"D\",\"correctOption\":\"d\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"question_code\":\"CHE-THE-8034\",\"question_type\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"correct_option\":\"d\"},\"questionId\":\"ec5a8792-5b4f-4c56-9057-099b3a5c3f09\"},{\"id\":\"blk-1788170102677-0-11\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"d13419a9-5fe8-42ea-81b8-5c0398c110d2\",\"year\":null,\"marks\":4,\"source\":\"System Admin\",\"chapter\":\"Thermodynamics\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1\",\"text\":\"<p>200 joules of heat was supplied to a system at constant volume. It resulted in the increase in temperature of the system from 298 to 323 K. What is the change in internal energy of the system?</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"ae3ca408-6882-4b58-8d85-b2bf406a3b90\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>400 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>400 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"0d684ca0-de18-4fd4-b1b6-4e2782f330fd\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>200 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>200 J</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"3d47b8fa-bf3e-4b2a-ae30-4f20684ce258\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>50 J<