vin</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>kelvin</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"1532c12b-7b03-4a08-b3f5-cc65cf8b9cdb\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>metre</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>metre</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"80bea398-2ae5-4199-806a-0e6af8d79ef3\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>metre/second</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>metre/second</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Which of the following is a derived unit?</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"solution\":[],\"sectionId\":\"sec-2\",\"sectionName\":\"Part B: CHEMISTRY (MCQ)\",\"correctAnswer\":\"d\",\"correctOption\":\"d\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"questionNumber\":97,\"explanationText\":[]}},{\"id\":\"blk-0f8558df-268b-4266-abcf-578f8d4e38bb-0.8204551411313018\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"0f8558df-268b-4266-abcf-578f8d4e38bb\",\"marks\":4,\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1788263324356\",\"text\":\"<p>Which of the following statements is not true regarding molecular orbital theory?</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"e51af1ca-4a04-4349-a6ea-a0e21ceb8f02\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>The atomic orbitals of comparable energies combine to form molecular orbitals.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>The atomic orbitals of comparable energies combine to form molecular orbitals.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"44e8b419-c593-4dd8-9d74-48af0d4a0ebb\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>An atomic orbital is monocentric while a molecular orbital is polycentric.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>An atomic orbital is monocentric while a molecular orbital is polycentric.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"9f049653-d7a2-4a2a-a6f3-140f93dd468f\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>Bonding molecular orbital has higher energy than antibonding molecular orbital.</p>\",\"type\":\"