 isothermal reversible expansion process, the value of q can be calculated by the expression</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"d2578de5-4d88-4675-b5ca-2ee2ca8a1765\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>q = 2.303nRT log(V₂/V₁)</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>q = 2.303nRT log(V₂/V₁)</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"8455aaa5-c0b1-4ebc-8076-5a3738b8da0e\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>q = −2.303nRT log(V₂/V₁)</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>q = −2.303nRT log(V₂/V₁)</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"65c4beb2-fc5a-44bb-84dc-cf87b0d178c8\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>q = −nRT log(V₁/V₂)</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>q = −nRT log(V₁/V₂)</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"fea39216-19f5-418b-a75c-db13a72b8d7d\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>q = −Pₑₓ nRT log(V₁/V₂)</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>q = −Pₑₓ nRT log(V₁/V₂)</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>For an isothermal reversible expansion process, the value of q can be calculated by the expression</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"solution\":[],\"sectionId\":\"sec-2\",\"sectionName\":\"Part B: CHEMISTRY (MCQ)\",\"correctAnswer\":\"a\",\"correctOption\":\"a\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"questionNumber\":155,\"explanationText\":[]}},{\"id\":\"blk-ec5a8792-5b4f-4c56-9057-099b3a5c3f09-0.8119120445492194\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"ec5a8792-5b4f-4c56-9057-099b3a5c3f09\",\"marks\":4,\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1\",\"text\":\"<p>Two litres of an ideal gas at a pressure of 10 atm expands isothermally into a vacuum until its total volume is 10 litres. How much heat is absorbed and how much work is done in the expansion?</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"3fc59bea-279d-4aee-bd29-d78a5f12370d\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>10 J, 10 J</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>10 J, 10 J</p>\"