the rule which is not correctly stated about the determination of significant figures.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"83348a70-97ba-475a-8a80-a3408c2224dc\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>Zeros preceding to first non-zero digit are not significant.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Zeros preceding to first non-zero digit are not significant.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"a91bc5e4-1749-4a4e-b913-59d1a60d4f03\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>Zeros between two non-zero digits are not significant.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Zeros between two non-zero digits are not significant.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"9b4f30e9-f10c-4787-a8a0-a3f2415c4641\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>Zeros at the end or right of the number are significant if they are on the right side of decimal point.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Zeros at the end or right of the number are significant if they are on the right side of decimal point.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"dc73d3f6-3121-4075-ba03-1bb62022d951\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>All non-zero digits are significant.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>All non-zero digits are significant.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Mark the rule which is not correctly stated about the determination of significant figures.</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"chapterId\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b13\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T05:58:40.403+00:00\",\"subjectId\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T07:57:22.032+00:00\",\"chapter_id\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b13\",\"difficulty\":\"Medium\",\"subject_id\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"explanation\":\"<p>All non-zero digits are significant.</p>\",\"chapter_name\":\"Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry\",\"optionLayout\":\"grid_2x2\"