b25-4397-b41a-e39dbae69247\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>Both are inaccurate scientifically.</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>Both are inaccurate scientifically.</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<ol start=\\\"8\\\"><li><p>Two students X and Y report the weight of the same substance as 4.0 g and 4.00 g respectively. Which of the following statements is correct?</p></li></ol><p></p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"chapterId\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b13\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T06:00:36.292+00:00\",\"subjectId\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-31T08:05:23.172+00:00\",\"chapter_id\":\"b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380b13\",\"difficulty\":\"Hard\",\"subject_id\":\"a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12\",\"explanation\":\"<p>Y is more accurate than X.</p>\",\"chapter_name\":\"Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry\",\"optionLayout\":\"grid_2x2\",\"questionCode\":\"CHE-SOM-5591\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"subject_name\":\"Chemistry\",\"correctAnswer\":\"C\",\"correctOption\":\"c\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"question_code\":\"CHE-SOM-5591\",\"question_type\":\"MCQ_SINGLE\",\"correct_option\":\"c\"},\"questionId\":\"09f1e615-30db-4259-848c-42fdcdeebe51\"},{\"id\":\"blk-1788170105297-1-9\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"b1c6ca03-fe29-4283-a949-6fe42d446df8\",\"year\":null,\"marks\":4,\"source\":\"System Admin\",\"chapter\":\"Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry\",\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1\",\"text\":\"<p>Which set of figures will be obtained after rounding up the following up to three significant figures?</p><p>34.216, 0.04597, 10.4107</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"c4b08f18-f0a0-4470-948b-34299b95c8b1\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>34.3, 0.0461, 10.4</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>34.3, 0.0461, 10.4</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"239e4cc3-c845-4b11-9005-446eb40ee957\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"