liquid is stirred with a paddle to increase the temperature then which of the following is true?</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"solution\":[],\"sectionId\":\"sec-2\",\"sectionName\":\"Part B: CHEMISTRY (MCQ)\",\"correctAnswer\":\"a\",\"correctOption\":\"a\",\"negativeMarks\":1,\"questionNumber\":148,\"explanationText\":[]}},{\"id\":\"blk-19ce7a61-413a-4e9e-aaac-ed040e71f98b-0.0903300692861253\",\"type\":\"question\",\"question\":{\"id\":\"19ce7a61-413a-4e9e-aaac-ed040e71f98b\",\"marks\":4,\"content\":[{\"id\":\"blk-1\",\"text\":\"<p>According to the first law of thermodynamics, ΔU = q + w. In special cases the statement can be expressed in different ways. Which of the following is not a correct expression?</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"options\":[{\"id\":\"36dcdb5c-6144-46a3-91fc-12774038cc3a\",\"key\":\"A\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>At constant temperature: q = −w</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>At constant temperature: q = −w</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"a\"},{\"id\":\"a5dbccea-d8fe-4f91-b8cd-928834b48b60\",\"key\":\"B\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>When no work is done: ΔU = q</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>When no work is done: ΔU = q</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"b\"},{\"id\":\"535ceb46-5277-410a-b3e0-d896f67a7b95\",\"key\":\"C\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>In gaseous system: ΔU = q + PΔV</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>In gaseous system: ΔU = q + PΔV</p>\",\"isCorrect\":false,\"option_key\":\"c\"},{\"id\":\"e826d9b1-d5f3-4d0c-9ab6-e270a470a30f\",\"key\":\"D\",\"content\":[{\"html\":\"<p>When work is done by the system: ΔU = q + w</p>\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>When work is done by the system: ΔU = q + w</p>\",\"isCorrect\":true,\"option_key\":\"d\"}],\"rawText\":\"<p>According to the first law of thermodynamics, ΔU = q + w. In special cases the statement can be expressed in different ways. Which of the following is not a correct expression?</p>\",\"subject\":\"Chemistry\",\"solution\":[